msgid "ticks is extended, monotonically increasing within one nonzero domain/epoch. Its owner extends counter wrap and changes epoch on reset, discontinuity or rate change. Domain and epoch are assembly-local identities, not clocks synchronized across cores, security domains or devices. UNKNOWN carries no usable measurement. Frequency is exact stated ticks/second, not measured accuracy. A known zero uncertainty states zero error; unknown uncertainty has a separate flag. These facts do not establish physical precision, causal pairing or event identity by themselves."
