msgid "Request, sample span, source frame descriptor and duty span must be naturally aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. The caller has consumed prior results and joined every adapter observer before preparing again. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected; an expired finite deadline can be prepared but cannot admit new physical effects. Preparation does not access sample contents, borrow hardware or establish rate/region support. Failure leaves the initialized request unchanged."
msgstr "Request, sample span, source frame descriptor and duty span must be naturally aligned, nonwrapping and disjoint. The caller has consumed prior results and joined every adapter observer before preparing again. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected; an expired finite deadline can be prepared but cannot admit new physical effects. Preparation does not access sample contents, borrow hardware or establish rate/region support. Failure leaves the initialized request unchanged."

